{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40356","headline":"中秋月 · 许昼","name":"中秋月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"应是蟾宫别有情，每逢秋半倍澄清。\n清光不向此中见，白发争教何处生？\n闲地占将真可惜，幽窗分得始爲明。\n殷勤好长来年桂，莫遣平人道不平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许昼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}